tool.transform.name = Shanduko yo Vhofholowaho
tool.transform.description = Shanduko yo Vhofholowaho. U i shumisa zwi vula bogisi ḽa tshanduko ḽo monaho ḽeyara i shumaho: kokodza khuḓa u shandula saizi, kokodza nnḓa ha khuḓa u monisa, kokodza lurumbu u sendamisa. A hu na tshine tsha ṅwalwa u swika zwi tshi khwaṱhisedzwa (Enter), nahone u khantsela (Escape) zwi vhuedzedza ḽeyara he ya vha i hone.
